  "body_html": "<h1>Tensor Product Lattice Function</h1>\n<p>Given lattice functions \\(L\\) on \\(V\\) and \\(L'\\) on \\(V'\\), their tensor product lattice function on \\(W=V\\otimes_D V'\\) is\n\\[\n(L\\otimes L')_t=\\sum_{r+r'=t} L_r\\otimes_{o_D}L'_{r'}.\n\\]\nIts jump set satisfies\n\\[\n\\operatorname{Jump}(L\\otimes L')=\\operatorname{Jump}(L)+\\operatorname{Jump}(L').\n\\]</p>\n<p>For building points \\(x\\in B(G)\\) and \\(x'\\in B(G')\\), this construction gives the lattice function \\(B_{x,x'}=L_x\\otimes L_{x'}\\) used in the generalized lattice model of the oscillator representation.</p>",
  "proof_html": null,
